WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:05.340
Mizuki Himeji is passionate about everything.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.010
Today, as always, she is reading a handbook about something she doesn't know.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.970
How to deliver a love letter.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.220
I guess the best way is to do it in person.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.470
You're more likely to get a positive reply if you tell them directly...

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:18.820
Studying, Himeji?

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:19.310
You're more likely to get a positive reply if you tell them directly...

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.860
Heartbeat Meter

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.320
Yoshii!

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:22.840
Heartbeat Meter

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.770
Yeah, just learning something new...

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:25.960
Heartbeat Meter

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.070
Right! Now's my chance to
toughen up and give it to him!

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:29.730
<b>Tough up</b>

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.240
Heartbeat Meter

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.530
Y-Yoshii...

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.290
Please take this!

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:41.550
Umm...

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.010
Please don't laugh at it!

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:51.620
Oh my gosh! I messed up!

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.050
What's so funny about it?

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:03.870
Something that grows when its alone, What is it?

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.150
One more chance, One more chance!

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:06.530
Never, Never give up!

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:07.830
One more chance, One more chance!

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.130
Never give up!

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:22.260
Meeting with someone else is easy

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:25.030
I decided what to say before they even asked

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:27.640
My heart beats fast thinking if I passed or not

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:29.820
I can't panic in this fight for love

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:32.890
Study! Study! Study! Keeps me up all night

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:35.520
I've got a dreaming genius inside me

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.100
I'd be great if everyone's wishes came true

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.270
I won't care about other people's lives

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:43.230
Perfect-area complete!

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:45.860
I'll definitely be waiting for you!

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:52.260
I can hear your voice from the Perfect-area!

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.570
Ah! Ear! Ear!

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:56.840
Why? Why can't stop when I pass you

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:59.450
if I'm your counselor

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:02.040
"Are we friends?" Yes, we're friends."

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:04.040
But, I failed the test with a 0

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:07.350
No! I'll take it again! and again!

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.490
I'm serious. One more chance, please

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:13.960
There's something better for is in the future

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:20.050
Better than my life right now.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:23.880
Tenth Period
Mock Test and Phantom Thief and Love Letter

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:29.070
Akihisa Yoshii of class F welcomes another new morning.

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:29.100
Wake up, Aki!
Tenth Period
Mock Test and Phantom Thief and Love Letter

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.250
Wake up, Aki!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.750
It's morning already.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:34.970
I wanna sleep...

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:36.380
I have no choice then.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:40.490
I'll wake you up with a good morning kiss.

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:43.550
I'm awake! I'm awake already!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:44.670
Really?

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:49.410
Then I'll give you a kiss for a safe trip in advance.

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.430
I don't care if it's in advance or in installments!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.930
That's too bad.

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:55.950
I guess I'll give up on family bonding for now.

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.350
Go change your clothes.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.350
Breakfast is ready.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.780
Breakfast? I thought you didn't know how to cook.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.150
Calorie Maido

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.610
I guessed right.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.110
It's healthy and balanced.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.790
I picked up the drinkable type because of how rushed we are in the mornings.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:13.700
I don't think you can really call this breakfast...

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.540
Well, it's nutritious enough, so whatever...

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.910
We have to get enough calories to last us the day in the morning.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:24.130
We don't use a lot of energy at night, so the healthiest policy is to eat lightly.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.410
I guess you're right.

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:29.400
A person needs around 2500 kcals each day.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.590
My idea is that you get 1000 kcal during both breakfast and lunch,

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:36.400
and then only 500kcal at dinner.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:39.110
One can of this is 200 kcals.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.900
You have to drink five of these at breakfast, which is about a liter.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.190
That's too much...

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:48.600
And you'll have 13 cans a day, which is 2.6 liters. The math works out perfectly.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.830
There's no way I can drink that much...

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.340
Don't worry.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:55.170
I bought a few different varieties so you don't get tired of them.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.650
The main course is composed of normal flavored ones,

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.020
the appetizer is the corn soup one,

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.750
and the beverage is coffee flavored.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.340
Finally, you can pick either the
caramel or the cocoa for dessert.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.170
That's not the problem!

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:06.910
Oh right... I'm sorry.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:10.810
I forgot that you're still growing,

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:12.880
so I guess this won't be enough.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.130
Stop! No more, please!

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:19.330
Akihisa's pleasant mornings are but distant memories now.

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.830
Couldn't she have at least bought some of the solid type...

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:26.440
Hmm?

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:29.130
What are you doing, Voyeur?

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.610
Periodic samplings.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.120
Sampling?

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:39.660
A census of the bust size in our school.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:43.170
You're an A-cup if the top to bottom of your breast measures 10cm.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.910
Add another 2.5cm, you're a B-cup, and another 2.5 makes you a C, and so on.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.660
B C A A B D B B C B A...

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.310
Oh, a G!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.550
D A B A...

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:54.270
Wasn't that a D?

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.860
That's a phony.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:57.900
Damn, you're good.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.320
Wow, she's pretty damn flat.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.730
Is that an A-cup?

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:07.650
No. You go down to AA if you subtract 2.5cm from A, then AAA, etc.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:12.070
She looks like she'd be a quadruple A...

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:15.530
Shit! You're going to pop off my kneecap!

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:18.460
I have human rights too!

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.880
No looking.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.710
A little more... A little more...

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.970
I surrender!

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:37.130
Stop!

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:41.430
Looks like it's pretty lively in here.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.390
Hideyoshi, why are you dressed like that?

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:45.320
Oh, I know.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.720
You're here to heal me!

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.540
The costume belongs to the drama club.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:56.000
They told me it fits, but it looks like a female one...

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.410
Make that a male nurse!

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:01.870
Oh? Did I read the script wrong?

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.960
No wonder there's no opening in the front side of the underwear.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:05.700
Front side...

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.840
But the upper underwear is openable...

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.340
Look at yourselves.

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:14.560
Do you have any sense of shame?

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:17.560
Sister!

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:21.270
Cut it out, Hideyoshi.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:25.230
People will think I'm an idiot too if you do stupid crap like that.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.450
I'm not doing stupid crap.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.690
See, that's why you're an idiot. You don't even know what you're doing wrong.

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:31.860
I mean, I know class F is as bad as it gets,

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.770
but just look at how many dumbasses you have.

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.280
I'm ashamed of even going to the same school as you guys.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.790
That was uncalled for.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.980
The truth hurts.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:45.530
Or are you saying that your grades have improved since then?

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:49.330
This is a school.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.260
Why don't you study a little harder instead if you have time to mess around?

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.580
Let's go, Rep.

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:03.800
Mizuki Himeji is currently reading her handbook.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.730
How to deliver a love letter.

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:11.030
If you're not brave enough to deliver it yourself, you could ask a friend to do it for you.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:14.190
Friend, huh?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:15.660
Minami...

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:16.480
What's the matter?

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.870
Well, you know... About Yoshii...

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:20.870
That's...

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.380
Don't tell me you...

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.300
You too!?

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.870
...have ones I don't have.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:36.380
I should ask a friend of Yuuji's, not one of mine...

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:37.770
Sakamoto...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:38.420
What's the matter?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.950
I have a request for you.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:44.050
You know, this love letter...

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:49.480
Hold it right there, Shouko! I didn't do anything!

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.470
You're mine.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.060
A marriage contract!?

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.780
No! Don't do this!

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.130
I'd rather die than sign that!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.770
If you find it too hard to deliver the love letter by itself,

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:06.990
you could give him a present along with it.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:08.760
Umm, Yoshii...

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.250
What's up?

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:15.410
Actually, I have something for you.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:18.590
I baked some cookies this morni-

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:23.010
Huh? Yoshii?

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.920
Yoshii!

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:28.060
Where are you!?

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.300
I was here first.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.020
Quiet!

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:34.180
If she finds us, we're both dead meat...

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.700
Screwing off again, huh, Yoshii?

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:41.340
Ironman!

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:42.320
Great timing.

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:44.090
I need some help moving things.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:50.450
You could sneak it in his bag or shoebox.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:54.870
If you do that, he'll think you're the modest type and his affection points for you will rise.

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:58.030
I should've done this from the very beginning...

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.210
What are you doing, Mizuki?

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:03.430
Well...!

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.430
That's...

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.940
W-What...

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:18.280
Yuuji, where are you?

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.750
If Shouko gets her hands on this...

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:26.160
My life is over!

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:27.780
I'm finally done.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:31.460
The complete bust size census. No copies allowed.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:37.090
I didn't manage to put it in his shoebox...

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:39.010
What should I do?

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:41.230
This letter is...

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.790
I'm okay with this...

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.090
Wait! Where's my love letter!?

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.470
Did I drop it back there?

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:53.530
Seriously! Why always me!?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.070
Feedback!

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.690
Oww...

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.280
What's that?

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:05.780
Wait, is this a cheat sheet for the placement exam!?

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:07.780
If I read this...

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.620
and know the questions beforehand...

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:11.770
I'll be able to ace it!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.540
Just kidding.

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.490
That's cheating.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:20.120
Besides, people would get suspicious if I suddenly got a perfect score.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.590
Oh, the box is damaged.

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:25.690
What should I do?

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.050
I guess I'll just take one of the
cardboard boxes in our classroom.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.770
Finally...

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:36.180
You'll see them again during the mock exam.

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:37.950
Better start preparing now.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.150
All right...

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:42.330
Found it!

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:44.840
Thank goodness, I f-

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:48.330
Delivery statement?

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:02.890
What happened, Himeji?

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.750
You don't look so good.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:05.670
Yoshii!

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:08.170
Umm... Well...

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:09.270
What's the matter?

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.110
Just ask me if it's something you think I can help with.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.160
Yoshii...

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.610
Actually...

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:17.820
I can't find it!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.820
Where the hell is my marriage contract!?

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:23.720
All my hard work put into the bust size list!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.910
My prized photos! They were so hard to get!

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.630
Where's my costume!?

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.160
What could've happened?

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:33.330
I locked it up in the secure vault and keyed it for more protection...

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.830
Oh, those cardboard boxes? Ironman took a few.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.370
What!?

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:38.940
And then...

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:41.750
An important letter!?

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.680
Do you remember where you could've dropped it?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.850
I looked in quite a few places, but I only found this.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.520
That's the delivery statement for the mock exams.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:55.530
Wait... did I mix them up back when I dropped it?

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:57.570
The vault is secured.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:59.460
Students can't open it by themselves.

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:01.870
What should I do...?

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:03.380
We're going to help.

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:04.960
We can do it!

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:07.010
We're friends, aren't we? You should've told us about it!

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:08.650
Friends have to help each other out.

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:09.720
Yuuji!

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:10.220
Guys!

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:14.200
Stuff of ours got locked up in there too.

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:16.840
They might be worthless to others...

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:18.630
But they hold memories dear to us!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.050
We will get them back no matter what!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:22.560
Guys...

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:24.800
You're the greatest!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.940
We'll combine our strength!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.720
If not their hearts.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.520
So this is the vault, huh?

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:35.060
Dual-layer protection with a secret password and a lock.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:38.690
That means we need to crack both of them to get in...

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:39.980
Tough security.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.930
Aki, use your Being to break open that damn door!

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:44.770
I'll be the one taking the fall if I do that...

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:47.590
That's right! I've got a good idea!

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:48.410
What is it?

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:51.000
I've played a phantom thief in a play before.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:54.750
He used a special technique to steal treasures from inside vaults.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.050
So, what is it?

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:00.360
First of all, you need to prepare some fake treasures.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:02.340
Then, you show them to the owner of the real treasures

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.100
and lie, saying that his treasures are stolen.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.760
He'll rush back to the vault to see if his suspicions are true,

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:11.520
and that's when you actually steal everything.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.720
Wow!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:13.950
You're so smart!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.230
Even an idiot can understand that!

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.780
All righty! Let's follow that plan!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.940
Ironman! Look at this!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.540
This is the mock exam!

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.760
Then hand it over.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:36.950
Umm... You're not going to open the vault to check?

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:40.860
Why would I do that? You're holding the damn thing.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:44.230
But... Uh... Huh?

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:45.890
That didn't work.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:47.610
But it worked on stage...

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:49.140
What's the difference?

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:49.810
The scenario.

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:52.380
It looks like we have no choice but to blast it open ourselves!

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:53.280
But how?

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:55.430
There's a key and a password.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.110
What do you plan to do about them?

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:58.890
I'll help you out.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:00.830
Who are you?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:04.370
Kyouji Nemoto. 2B's class president.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.040
You just want to open the vault, correct?

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.150
Want me to help?

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.080
Can you really?

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:12.330
Well, I won't be able to do it alone.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.720
If you guys get the key, I'll deal with the password.

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:16.770
Really!?

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.500
Yeah, I promise.

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:21.040
We should help each other when we're in trouble.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.740
Thanks, Nemoto!

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:26.420
Where is it?

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:27.250
That's it!

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.540
That's the key to the vault.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.950
You're kidding! Mr. Nishimura's sitting right in front of it!

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:31.770
What should we do?

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.070
We're doomed.

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.400
All right, let's bait him.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:37.940
Bait?

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.710
Someone has to put their life on the line and attract his attention.

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:42.200
We'll use that opportunity to grab the key.

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:44.320
Hideyoshi is best suited for that.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:45.280
Why me?

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.630
Because we can't let Himeji do that...

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:50.820
And Minami won't work either, she's not hot at- my bad!

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:52.270
Argentina Style Back Breaker

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.270
Who's not hot!?

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.370
What the hell are you kids doing!?

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.390
I can explain this...

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.220
It's not on purpose...

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:03.020
Owowowow! My skull!

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:05.880
God damn...

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.080
That looks painful.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:09.500
At least I managed to get the key while you were at it.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.900
Beautiful, Voyeur.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:13.970
It went just as planned.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:15.880
I was the bait!?

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.300
All right, it worked.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.970
The password's next.

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:21.920
Don't touch anything.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.190
If you enter the wrong password, an alarm will go off.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.030
Damn, you know your stuff.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:26.780
What should we do?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:27.560
Take a look at this.

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:29.150
That's...!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:29.740
Nice camera.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.860
I filmed Ironman opening it just then.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.540
You got the password on the camera!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:36.490
Right. This is today's secret password.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:41.880
Found it.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:44.420
Thank goodness it's here.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.090
Me too!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.550
I need to guard this more carefully...

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:49.500
Found it!

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:51.700
That's great, Himeji.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.940
Yeah, thank you very much!

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:58.120
Really... Thank you...

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.720
Found it! My costume!

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:05.590
The bra's here as well!

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.810
Oh god! It's a front hook type!

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:11.950
So that's what it looks like...

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:15.150
You've never seen a front hook bra before?

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:17.380
They never had one in my size.

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.750
Small hooks won't work because these are too big...

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:23.070
No way! That's not true! The hook is sturdy!

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:25.500
No one said front hook bras are for flat people!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.230
Too big...

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:31.010
So this is it.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:33.240
What are you doing, Nemoto?

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:35.560
Nothing, just studying a little.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.300
You can't do that, Nemoto!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.220
That's cheating!

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.320
What's the point of saying that now?

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:41.490
We're partners in crime.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:45.220
You all just trespassed into the vault with the exam, after all.

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:48.620
If we get caught, we're both screwed either way.

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:52.950
No... We're just here to get back the things we've lost.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.570
Do you really expect that excuse to work?

00:16:57.130 --> 00:17:00.970
Have you stayed in class F so long that their idiocy has infected you?

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:03.390
Results are everything in this world.

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:06.260
How you obtain the results doesn't matter.

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:07.800
No way... I don't care...

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:11.870
Even if I do solve the problems before the test,

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:14.250
I've still used my own ability to do so.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:17.640
It will merely be a coincidence that I receive the same questions on the day of the test.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:18.930
That's bullshit!

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:21.570
Are you going to throw this chance away?

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.970
That's why you're idiots.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:28.560
Nobody loses anything if I score a little higher.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.960
No one is going to gain anything from being honest.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.780
If you can't understand that, then you're in class F for a reason.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:39.240
You're not just terrible at academics, you're complete idiots in every respect.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.910
And that is why you guys have been sent to the school's garbage dump of a class.

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:44.200
You're wrong!

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:46.950
Himeji...

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.840
It's true that we have bad grades...

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.550
but everyone in our class is so nice!

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:54.890
So caring!

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:57.550
So much fun to be around! So kind...

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.470
It's a great class!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:01.650
Himeji...

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:05.140
We're not the worst! We're not garbage!

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:07.400
Whatever you say.

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:10.170
You guys will be suspended too if we get caught.

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:11.740
Maybe even expelled.

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:14.840
We're in the same boat here.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:18.900
Listen, I don't know anything about you guys being here.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:21.600
And you didn't see me here either.

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:23.120
That's all.

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:28.250
You guys better grow some brains.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:42.960
Yuuji, are we really... idiots?

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.870
Why are you asking that?

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:47.160
Of course we are.

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:48.750
I guess so.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.440
Not happy about it, huh?

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.360
I don't care if he calls me one.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:58.520
But it pisses me off that he groups everyone under that category.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:05.140
Himeji should be in class A.

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:08.890
She just got unlucky and ended up being sent to our class.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:14.420
So why is she being treated like an idiot too!?

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:19.230
Well, if it bothers you that much, wanna give it another shot?

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.400
It's been almost three months.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:25.740
We'll be able to declare another ESB soon.

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:30.710
Everyone went through a bunch of crap because I screwed up last time.

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:31.840
I'm sorry.

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:33.070
Yuuji...

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:35.880
But we're on the right path.

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:38.550
I refuse to make another
pathetic mistake like that again.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:43.940
So do you feel like giving it another shot?

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:46.490
Do you even have to ask?

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.200
Hell yeah I do!

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:53.200
We're going to win this time and show them we're not just mere idiots!

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:56.080
Let's declare another Exam Summoning Battle!

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:57.050
All right!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.590
We'll settle this for once and for all.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.890
Before that, I need to go fetch Himeji's cookies.

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:07.090
Good idea! We shouldn't be the only ones getting the short end of the stick.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.470
Awaken!

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:11.870
Summoning Being...

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:12.870
Summon!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:21.060
What's this?

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:24.280
It's the upcoming mock test...

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:28.550
That means if I'll be able to ace it if I know the questions on it!

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:35.610
Jesus Christ, idiots everywhere.

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.590
Leaked questions won't be used on the exam.

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:47.960
Did Aki do this?

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:49.100
Yoshii...

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:54.510
Yoshii! Sakamoto! What have you guys done this time!?

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:59.150
I'm sorry!

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.030
What the hell is the meaning of this!?

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.630
It was just a prank!

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:05.950
We went a bit overboard.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.670
Don't lie! What are you guys schem-

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:13.330
I'm really sorry.

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.210
Is there a reason behind this you can't tell me?

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.160
No, it's just a prank.

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:23.290
You think I'd believe that? You've never apologized like this before.

00:21:30.070 --> 00:21:30.970
Fine.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.500
Both of you are joining me in hell for supplementary lessons!

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:36.490
Prepare yourselves.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.710
I'm going to be stricter than ever.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:40.440
That'll teach you not to play pranks on people!

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:48.970
All right!

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:57.400
Baka, go go home!

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:03.570
Baka, go go home!

00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:06.840
It's a time of peace now that school's out

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:08.390
If I were to compare her

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:09.930
"She's a real angel!"

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:12.900
Then a sudden note ruined my fun

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:14.290
It said I have a makeup test!

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:15.680
It's hell!

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:19.020
I was joking with my friends,

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:22.050
"There's no way someone is that stupid!"

00:22:22.050 --> 00:22:25.130
But deep down inside,

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:26.420
I was screaming,

00:22:26.420 --> 00:22:29.380
"That was me! I'm that stupid!"

00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:35.960
I thought the "Monthly" sign in the parking lot

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:41.240
was the company's name!

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:43.990
For the longest time...

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:47.690
Stupidity is a manly character

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:50.390
Is that our lack of common sense?

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:53.700
Rules are useless in this world

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:56.700
Eat Korean BBQ every night and overthrow the masses!

00:22:56.700 --> 00:22:58.340
Look!

00:22:58.340 --> 00:23:02.910
The sun that rose from the west is now setting down.

00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:05.950
Run! It's almost dinner time.

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:12.820
Let's go home!

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:22.770
What's this?

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:24.120
A present from a girl?

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:27.330
I guess I'm popular after all.

00:23:27.330 --> 00:23:30.110
I have to finish this before Yuuka discovers it.

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:34.510
The sound of a soul being eaten away.

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:37.190
Question 11:

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:43.110
What was the tactic involving forceful concentration of tanks and artillery that the Germans used in WWII?

00:23:43.110 --> 00:23:44.190
Let's go, baby!

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:45.820
Value your life.

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:48.010
Next episode: Arch-enemy and Love Letter and Blitzkrieg.

00:23:48.010 --> 00:23:49.900
This will be on your test.
